"  <tr><td>529</td><td>529 Authentication account expired - Authenticatieaccount verlopen</td></tr>"
"  <tr><td>530</td><td>530 Access denied - authentication required - Toegang geweigerd (Authenticatie vereist)</td></tr>"
"  <tr><td>531</td><td>531 Access denied (Sendmailism) - Toegang geweigerd (Sendmail)</td></tr>"
"  <tr><td>532</td><td>532 Access denied - not authenticated - Toegang geweigerd: niet geverifieerd</td></tr>"
"  <tr><td>533</td><td>533 Access denied - account locked - Toegang geweigerd: account vergrendeld</td></tr>"
"  <tr><td>534</td><td>534 Access denied - account disabled - Toegang geweigerd: account uitgeschakeld</td></tr>"
"  <tr><td>535</td><td>535 Authentication failed - Authenticatie mislukt (AUTH)</td></tr>"
"  <tr><td>536</td><td>536 Authentication required for relay (Postfix) - Authenticatie vereist voor relay (Postfix)</td></tr>"
